  "limitations": [
    "One bounded coherent input trace; no claim of complete LEDGERS coverage, all eras or arbitrary generated blocks.",
    "The third original transaction has phase-2 scripts; these are unchanged signed bytes.",
    "Haskell accumulates predicate failures; Scarab fails fast. A Scala rejection is compared with the native accumulated typed failure payloads, without requiring identical failure order or multiplicity.",
    "The separate formal LEDGERS SIGSEGV remains uninvestigated and is not counted as a formal pass.",
    "MemPack native output lacks original TxOut raw bytes and Scala UTxO change-history bookkeeping; all output fields and remaining typed state are compared."
  ],
